  "陈邦杰 · 首席产品设计官": ["Chen Pang-Chieh · Chief Product Officer","Chen Pang-Chieh · Director de Producto","陳邦傑 · 最高製品責任者","Chen Pang-Chieh · Directeur produit","Chen Pang-Chieh · Chief Product Officer","Chen Pang-Chieh · مدير المنتج","Chen Pang-Chieh · Giám đốc sản phẩm","Chen Pang-Chieh · मुख्य उत्पाद अधिकारी", "陳邦傑 · 首席產品設計官"],
